    <!-- The cleaning-disk drawing's own 24x24 geometry, shared between the cleanup dialog's centre
         animation (CleanupWindow.xaml) and the main toolbar's cleanup button (the button shows
         this same disk, animated, while a cleanup runs, instead of a plain broom glyph). Kept in one place
         so the two never drift apart; the sparkle/glint geometry stays local to CleanupWindow.xaml, since
         the toolbar button deliberately never shows it: the disk keeps its animation, minus the stars. -->
